  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 916ca174c9f91bc47ab29cda8fbdcf0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Memory_pan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MemoryData
  openingLine: This reminds me of...
  lines:
  - Mom made everything in this pan. Eggs, rice, the soup she always made when I
    got sick.
  - I could smell it from my room before I was even all the way awake.
  - "She never measured anything. \u201CYou just know,\u201D she\u2019d say."
  - "I tried to make her soup once. It didn\u2019t taste anything like hers."
  - "The kitchen\u2019s been quiet for a while now."
  - Nothing in this house smells like home anymore.
